    "status": "video-observed",
    "html": "<section class=\"ri-sample\" data-ri=\"form\" aria-labelledby=\"ri-form-title\"><div class=\"ri-shell ri-form-grid\"><div class=\"ri-form-aside\"><div><h3 class=\"ri-heading\" id=\"ri-form-title\">전문가 상담 폼</h3><p class=\"ri-copy\">영상에서 문의 폼과 좌측 그래픽 구성이 관찰됩니다. 실제 적용을 위해 필수값 검증, 인라인 오류, 성공/실패/지연 상태를 같은 화면에서 재현합니다.</p></div><div class=\"ri-line-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ri-map-path\"></span></div></div><form novalidate><div class=\"ri-field-grid\"><label class=\"ri-field\"><span class=\"ri-label\">이름 *</span><input class=\"ri-input\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" data-ri-required required aria-required=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ri-name-error\"><span class=\"ri-error\" id=\"ri-name-error\"></span></label><label class=\"ri-field\"><span class=\"ri-label\">회사 *</span><input class=\"ri-input\" name=\"company\" autocomplete=\"organization\" data-ri-required required aria-required=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ri-company-error\"><span class=\"ri-error\" id=\"ri-company-error\"></span></label><label class=\"ri-field ri-field-full\"><span class=\"ri-label\">이메일 *</span><input class=\"ri-input\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" data-ri-required required aria-required=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ri-email-error\"><span class=\"ri-error\" id=\"ri-email-error\"></span></label><label class=\"ri-field ri-field-full\"><span class=\"ri-label\">데모 결과</span><select class=\"ri-select\" data-ri-form-mode><option value=\"success\">성공</option><option value=\"pending\">지연 후 성공</option><option value=\"failure\">실패</option></select></label></div><div class=\"ri-button-row\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"ri-button ri-button-primary\" type=\"submit\" aria-busy=\"false\">상담 요청</button><button class=\"ri-button\" type=\"reset\">초기화</button></div><p class=\"ri-status\" data-ri-form-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">제출 결과는 데모 선택값으로 재현합니다. 네트워크 요청은 발생하지 않습니다.</p></form></div></section>"
