    "status": "video-observed",
    "html": "<section class=\"ri-sample\" data-ri=\"theme\" data-ri-storage-key=\"reference-interactions-theme-demo\" aria-labelledby=\"ri-theme-title\"><div class=\"ri-shell\"><h3 class=\"ri-heading\" id=\"ri-theme-title\">범위 제한 테마 선택</h3><p class=\"ri-copy\">영상에서는 전역 다크 전환이 관찰됩니다. 이 샘플은 실제 제품 적용을 위해 컨테이너 범위에서 system/light/dark를 안전하게 저장합니다.</p><div class=\"ri-segment-row\" style=\"margin-top:24px\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"테마 선택\"><button class=\"ri-button\" type=\"button\" data-ri-theme-choice=\"system\" aria-pressed=\"true\">시스템</button><button class=\"ri-button\" type=\"button\" data-ri-theme-choice=\"light\" aria-pressed=\"false\">라이트</button><button class=\"ri-button\" type=\"button\" data-ri-theme-choice=\"dark\" aria-pressed=\"false\">다크</button></div><div class=\"ri-theme-preview\"><p class=\"ri-status\" data-ri-theme-status aria-live=\"polite\">현재 샘플 테마: system</p><div class=\"ri-theme-swatch-row\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ri-theme-swatch\" style=\"background:var(--color-bg)\"></div><div class=\"ri-theme-swatch\" style=\"background:var(--color-surface)\"></div><div class=\"ri-theme-swatch\" style=\"background:var(--color-text)\"></div><div class=\"ri-theme-swatch\" style=\"background:var(--color-action)\"></div></div></div></div></section>"
